id: pm-c1dwbt
title: "GH-1306: Isolate merge driver installation and health across Git worktrees"
description: Installing drivers in one linked worktree must not redirect other worktrees to its pinned binary. Health rejects mismatched runtime paths and reinstall converges without losing existing repository configuration.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
