resolution: Worktree-local merge runtime installation and health delivered
expected_result: Sibling worktrees retain independent merge runtimes and health identifies incompatible configured drivers.
actual_result: Linked merge and integrity tests pass; real Git migration and yes/on scenarios pass; new module exact coverage; obsolete local drivers repaired through pm.
