comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T10:11:12.057Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete live all-status 2801-item inventory and request-specific searches found no owner for GH-1306. Reuse pm-o2kc and historical pm-w91mvg. Report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1306"
  "2026-09-25T10:31:10.830Z","harness:codex","Regression evidence: a real linked-worktree test failed before the fix because installing in the linked tree replaced the main driver. Three real-Git tests now pass: worktree isolation/removal, foreign sibling and exact-version drift, main-only core setting migration and unreadable config. New migration module focused coverage is exact 27/27 statements, 17/17 branches, 2/2 functions, 22/22 lines; broader repository coverage is running."
  "2026-09-25T10:54:25.715Z","harness:codex","Final configuration review against https://git-scm.com/docs/git-worktree#_configuration_file confirmed main-only core.bare/core.worktree migration. Boolean keys now use Git typed reads, preserving valid yes/on spellings as well as true. Real-Git regression assertions cover enabled yes and migration from core.bare=on."
  "2026-09-25T11:03:37.913Z","harness:codex","Live dogfood: health correctly detected five configured merge drivers pointing at an obsolete temporary checkout. Backed up clone-local Git configuration and ran pm merge install; all five drivers now reference the current checkout, with no .gitattributes change. This runtime configuration repair is local and is not a tracked host-specific runbook."
  "2026-09-25T11:05:03.943Z","harness:codex","Fresh-build regression passes all three real-Git worktree scenarios, including yes/on normalization. The new worktree configuration module has exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, with 21/21 branches. Earlier full-run failures loaded old source before edits made during that run; a clean rerun resolves those failures."
  "2026-09-25T11:07:15.578Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence: all four linked test commands passed sequentially with zero assertion failures or timeouts. Changed-source typecheck and ESLint pass. Hosted exact-head static and full coverage gates remain required before merge; prior full-run failure details were investigated and corrected without relaxing gates."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T10:29:46.091Z","harness:codex",Git local configuration is shared by linked worktrees. Native worktree configuration must preserve main-only core settings and existing main drivers before isolating future installations.
